    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/ff5e6bff708042591efb15a7167c5114.avif?t=1741544972\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><br>Felampire beckons you into the shadows of its 2D Metroidvania realm. Embrace the essence of a mysterious cat, brought to life within the sacred confines of an ancient crypt. Awaken without memories, alone, yet filled with unfathomable powers just waiting to be unleashed. Your odyssey unfolds in the labyrinthine passages beneath and stretches into the world above, where your kind is feared and scorned.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/aed7dafd4a936d64efa1e4839ae46d60.poster.avif?t=1741544972\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/aed7dafd4a936d64efa1e4839ae46d60.webm?t=1741544972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/aed7dafd4a936d64efa1e4839ae46d60.mp4?t=1741544972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/43f4e085580b9430831912fe0d8af1df.poster.avif?t=1741544972\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/43f4e085580b9430831912fe0d8af1df.webm?t=1741544972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/43f4e085580b9430831912fe0d8af1df.mp4?t=1741544972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/6650c7ca59270af84e8e2e8eb30f5413.avif?t=1741544972\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><br>Embark on a metroidvania platformer adventure unlike any other, where you play as a cat exploring the depth of crypts, acquiring mystical abilities, and navigating through long-forgotten ruins. Unravel puzzles, unlock ancient secrets, and discover the true essence of the felampire, all while piecing together your own mysterious origins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/5b10ec3886fae65fd8a7366d3482fca1.poster.avif?t=1741544972\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/5b10ec3886fae65fd8a7366d3482fca1.webm?t=1741544972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/5b10ec3886fae65fd8a7366d3482fca1.mp4?t=1741544972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/266524b581b1029413038818c11e71ed.poster.avif?t=1741544972\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/266524b581b1029413038818c11e71ed.webm?t=1741544972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/266524b581b1029413038818c11e71ed.mp4?t=1741544972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/d81be56f7419b7b4e840d6b073ffa236.avif?t=1741544972\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><br>Face formidable bosses and conquer them to assimilate their extraordinary powers, transforming the way you combat foes and traverse the enigmatic world of the crypts. Felampire invites you into a captivating tale of discovery, power, and identity, where your actions dictate the unfolding of a story far greater than yourself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/74990714afb0b1299ffcfb4f4dae7084.poster.avif?t=1741544972\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/74990714afb0b1299ffcfb4f4dae7084.webm?t=1741544972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/74990714afb0b1299ffcfb4f4dae7084.mp4?t=1741544972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/e0dce4ec088cc2132bf8a11ee183433e.avif?t=1741544972\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><br>Make tough decisions as you discover your heritage and what that means. You decide who you will side with. Navigate the shadows of uncertainty as you face moral dilemmas that shape the destiny of Aethermere. Choose forgiveness or vengeance, alliance or isolation, as you grapple with the consequences of your actions. The path you walk will define not only your journey, but the fate of the kingdom itself.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928580/extras/e25291b54c095fc641d673ef83c51f70.avif?t=1741544972\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2>",
